next.

577
00:18:58,326 --> 00:18:59,138
Try this.

578
00:18:59,318 --> 00:19:01,336
Once your emergency fund is full,

579
00:19:01,336 --> 00:19:03,536
write down a specific long term goal

580
00:19:03,536 --> 00:19:05,309
