00:19:05,489 --> 00:19:07,904
Purpose makes investing feel less risky.

582
00:19:08,254 --> 00:19:09,601
Lesson number twelve.

583
00:19:09,781 --> 00:19:11,858
Being a saver can become your whole

584
00:19:11,858 --> 00:19:12,393
identity.

585
