615
00:20:16,822 --> 00:20:18,261
Lesson number thirteen.

616
00:20:18,441 --> 00:20:20,763
Waiting for certainty keeps money idle.

617
00:20:21,114 --> 00:20:23,908
Many savers plan to invest once things

618
00:20:23,908 --> 00:20:26,481
