Every year in cash is a year

624
00:20:37,031 --> 00:20:39,691
of missed compounding and lost buying power.

625
00:20:40,041 --> 00:20:41,494
Dollar cost averaging,

626
00:20:41,494 --> 00:20:43,939
investing a fixed amount on a regular

627
00:20:43,939 --> 00:20:46,450
schedule, removes the need to pick the

628
00:20:46,450 --> 00:20:47,309
perfect time.

629
00:20:47,489 --> 00:20:49,478
You buy more shares when prices are

630
00:20:49,478 --> 00:20:51,297
low and fewer when they're high.

631
00:20:51,647 --> 00:20:53,871
You don't need to understand everything to

632
00:20:53,871 --> 00:20:54,189
start.

633
00:20:54,369 --> 00:20:55,787
A simple, low cost,

634
00:20:55,787 --> 00:20:59,294
