for many people.

636
00:21:00,838 --> 00:21:03,576
Remember too that investing isn't all or

637
00:21:03,576 --> 00:21:04,123
nothing.

638
00:21:04,303 --> 00:21:05,988
You don't have to move all your

639
00:21:05,988 --> 00:21:06,858
