644
00:21:14,731 --> 00:21:15,625
Try this.

645
00:21:15,805 --> 00:21:17,245
Set a date within the next two

646
00:21:17,245 --> 00:21:18,974
weeks to make your first investment.

647
00:21:19,154 --> 00:21:21,801
A deadline turns waiting into action.

648
00:21:22,151 --> 00:21:23,695
Lesson number fourteen.

649
00:21:23,875 --> 00:21:26,835
The rules changed since our grandparents' time.

650
00:21:27,186 --> 00:21:30,344
Decades ago, many workers had pensions.

651
00:21:30,524 --> 00:21:33,250
Employers promised a monthly check for life

652
