655
00:21:40,133 --> 00:21:43,443
Today, most private sector workers rely on

656
00:21:43,443 --> 00:21:46,123
four oh one k style plans instead.

657
00:21:46,303 --> 00:21:49,503
The responsibility for investing and making money

658
00:21:49,503 --> 00:21:52,573
