Money that needs to last three decades

670
00:22:16,436 --> 00:22:17,610
can't just sit still.

671
00:22:17,790 --> 00:22:19,422
It needs to keep growing,

672
00:22:19,422 --> 00:22:20,923
even during retirement,

673
00:22:20,923 --> 00:22:22,817
to keep up with rising costs.

674
00:22:23,167 --> 00:22:24,014
Try this.

675
00:22:24,194 --> 00:22:26,680
If your employer offers a retirement plan,

676
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:28,751
find out how it's invested and make

677
00:22:28,751 --> 00:22:30,763
sure your money isn't sitting in a

678
00:22:30,763 --> 00:22:32,124
cash option by default.

679
